('111.7.b.10.E',4,'Which choice would help a family with a budget shortage the MOST?','["ignoring the budget", "spending less on needs like rent", "buying more things on credit", "spending less on wants while still paying for needs"]'::jsonb,3,'Cut wants first; needs come first.','original'),
('111.7.b.10.D',3,'Which record would show how much money a family spent on groceries last month?','["saved store receipts", "a school schedule", "a map of the neighborhood", "a recipe book"]'::jsonb,0,'Receipts show what was bought and what it cost.','original'),
