('111.7.b.10.F',4,'Cara''s family budget for a month: income $2,500; expenses: rent $860, phone $110, clothes $90, transportation $130. How much money is left after all the expenses?','["$1,260", "$1,190", "$1,310", "$3,690"]'::jsonb,2,'Add the expenses: 1,190. Then 2,500 − 1,190 = 1,310.','original'),
('111.7.b.10.F',4,'Jo''s family budget for a month: income $3,500; expenses: rent $770, phone $140, food $570, clothes $220. How much money is left after all the expenses?','["$5,200", "$1,700", "$2,570", "$1,800"]'::jsonb,3,'Add the expenses: 1,700. Then 3,500 − 1,700 = 1,800.','original'),
('111.7.b.10.F',4,'Tia''s family budget for a month: income $4,200; expenses: rent $650, phone $130, transportation $240, food $260. How much money is left after all the expenses?','["$2,920", "$1,280", "$3,570", "$2,870"]'::jsonb,0,'Add the expenses: 1,280. Then 4,200 − 1,280 = 2,920.','original'),
