('111.7.b.10.F',4,'Cara''s family budget for a month: income $4,300; expenses: rent $920, clothes $210, phone $80, food $530. How much money is left after all the expenses?','["$1,740", "$6,040", "$2,560", "$2,510"]'::jsonb,2,'Add the expenses: 1,740. Then 4,300 − 1,740 = 2,560.','original'),
