('111.7.b.10.F',4,'Zoe''s monthly income is $1,530. Expenses are rent $660, food $470, and other costs $460. How much more are the expenses than the income? (This is how much must be cut to balance the budget.)','["$60", "$1,530", "$80", "$160"]'::jsonb,0,'Expenses: 660 + 470 + 460 = 1,590. 1,590 − 1,530 = 60.','original'),
